# Rocci tree appendix

This page is generated from `crates/rocci-template/Rocci.AST.ungram`. It is a tree spec for owned AST nodes, not the language of strings; scanners stay hand-written. Inspect tags live in `Rocci.AST.toml`. Do not edit this file by hand; run `cargo run -q -p rocci-ungram -- generate`.

## Productions

| Production | Inspect | Classification |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `Action` | omit | inline |
| `Attr` | `attr` | generated |
| `AttrValue` | omit | generated |
| `Boolean` | omit | inline |
| `ComponentCall` | `call` | generated |
| `ComponentDecl` | `component` | generated |
| `ComponentPath` | omit | generated |
| `ContextDecl` | `context` | generated |
| `CssDecl` | `css` | generated |
| `CssPayload` | — | leaf |
| `Document` | `module` | generated |
| `Element` | `element` | generated |
| `ElseIf` | `else-if` | inline |
| `Expr` | omit | inline |
| `FixtureDecl` | `fixture` | generated |
| `ForDirective` | `for` | generated |
| `Fragment` | `fragment` | generated |
| `Ident` | omit | generated |
| `IfDirective` | `if` | generated |
| `InitDecl` | `init` | generated |
| `Interpolation` | `interp` | generated |
| `LetDirective` | `let` | generated |
| `LiveDecl` | `live` | generated |
| `MatchArm` | `arm` | generated |
| `MatchDirective` | `match` | generated |
| `ModuleItem` | omit | generated |
| `OnDecl` | `on` | generated |
| `ParamList` | `params` | leaf |
| `RocExpr` | — | leaf |
| `RocPattern` | — | leaf |
| `RocRegion` | `roc` | inline |
| `RocType` | — | leaf |
| `Static` | omit | inline |
| `StringLit` | — | leaf |
| `TemplateBlock` | omit | generated |
| `TemplateItem` | omit | generated |
| `TextNode` | `text` | generated |
